Package: hanwoo
Title: A Tool for Animal Data Analysis of Hanwoo Cattle
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Youngjun", "Na", email = "ruminoreticulum@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A system for modeling the nutrient requirements of Hanwoo 
    (Korean native cattle). Provides functions to calculate nutritional 
    requirements based on the Korean Feeding Standard for Hanwoo. Also 
    includes API functions to retrieve cattle information from Korean 
    public data portals.
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
License: GPL-2
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
URL: https://github.com/adatalab/hanwoo
BugReports: https://github.com/adatalab/hanwoo/issues
Imports: 
    XML,
    httr,
    readr,
    dplyr,
    tibble,
    lubridate,
    qrcode
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
